{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_kafkaactor", "label": "KafkaActor", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Umschliesst kafkajs intern; man importiert es nicht direkt. Fuer Consumer-Group-Work-Sharing mehrere Actor-Instanzen mit derselben groupId nehmen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_kafkaoptions", "label": "KafkaOptionsType", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_producing", "label": "Producen", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Bei getrennter Verbindung gepuffert und beim Reconnect in Reihenfolge geflusht. Fuer strikte Reihenfolge innerhalb einer Partition producer.idempotent: true plus konsistenten key setzen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_consuming", "label": "Consumen", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "topics und das Laufzeit-subscribe speisen dieselbe gewuenschte Menge der Basisklasse, nicht den Consumer: ein zur Laufzeit ergaenztes Topic wird nach einem Reconnect neu subscribed. Konfigurierte Topics erben consumer.fromBeginning, eine Laufzeit-Ergaenzung startet beim aktuellen Offset.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_commit_modes", "label": "Commit-Modi", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "auto committet nach Rueckkehr des Handlers (at-least-once, Handler muessen idempotent sein); manual pausiert bei jedem Record und wartet auf eine explizite Commit-Nachricht (exactly-once-with-processing, wenn die Verarbeitung transaktional ist). commitTimeoutMs deckelt, wie lange die Pumpe wartet, bevor sie einen Rebalance ausloest.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_no_unsubscribe", "label": "Kein unsubscribe", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "kafkajs kann einem laufenden Consumer kein einzelnes Topic entziehen \u2014 den Actor stoppen oder einen zweiten mit anderer groupId starten, wenn ein Consumer wirklich eine andere Topic-Menge braucht.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_auth_and_tls", "label": "Auth + TLS", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "TLS und SASL-Credentials werden an kafkajs durchgereicht; Secrets gehoeren in Env-Variablen, nicht in application.conf.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_consumer_group_rebalance", "label": "Rebalancing der Consumer Group", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Rebalances verursachen kurze Nichtverfuegbarkeit; die Handler-Latenz muss innerhalb von Kafkas Session-Timeout (Default 30 s) bleiben, sonst fliegt der Consumer mitten im Handler aus der Gruppe.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_slow_handlers_fall_behind", "label": "Langsame Handler fallen zurueck", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "kafkajs deckelt die In-Flight-Rate: 500 ms pro Record heisst rund 2 Records/s. Fuer hochvolumigen Konsum innerhalb des Handlers parallelisieren oder Consumer-Group-Mitglieder hinzufuegen.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_broker_actor_base_desired_subscriptions", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_consuming", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_kafkaactor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_kafkaoptions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_kafkaactor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_producing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_kafkaactor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_consuming", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_commit_modes", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_consuming", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_no_unsubscribe", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_kafka_consuming", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/kafka.md